#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/subscription.rst:4
msgid "Подписка на событие Citeck"
msgstr "Subscribe to Citeck Event"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/subscription.rst:23
msgid "Пример: Выполнение действий при смене статуса"
msgstr "Example: Performing Actions on Status Change"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/subscription.rst:25
msgid ""
"Для выполнения действий при смене статуса можно использовать подписку на "
"события Citeck:"
msgstr ""
"To perform actions on status change, you can use a subscription to Citeck "
"events:"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/subscription.rst:46
msgid ""
"Далее можно взять список документов, через **GetRecordAttsProcessor** "
"получить их атрибуты (включая контент) и через http компонент отправить "
"на внешний сервис."
msgstr ""
"Next, you can take the list of documents, retrieve their attributes "
"(including content) using **GetRecordAttsProcessor**, and send them to an "
"external service via the HTTP component."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/subscription.rst:48
msgid ""
"Полная конфигурация с комментариями представлена во вложении. Для "
"сценария примера нужно поменять:"
msgstr ""
"The full configuration with comments is provided in the attachment. For "
"this example scenario, you need to change:"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/subscription.rst:50
msgid ""
"beans[0] -> properties -> FILE_TYPES_TO_PROCESS:     **['scan-document'] "
"-> ['SED-main-document']**"
msgstr ""
"beans[0] -> properties -> FILE_TYPES_TO_PROCESS:     **['scan-document'] "
"-> ['SED-main-document']**"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/subscription.rst:51
msgid ""
"route -> from -> parameters -> filter -> val[0] -> val:     **contract ->"
" SED-agreement**"
msgstr ""
"route -> from -> parameters -> filter -> val[0] -> val:     **contract ->"
" SED-agreement**"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/subscription.rst:52
msgid ""
"route -> from -> parameters -> filter -> val[1] -> val:     "
"**integration-trigger -> ваш_статус**"
msgstr ""
"route -> from -> parameters -> filter -> val[1] -> val:     "
"**integration-trigger -> your_status**"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/subscription.rst:54
msgid ""
"А так же создать :ref:`секрет <ecos_secret>` с **username/password** в "
"журнале ``/v2/journals?journalId=ecos-"
"secrets&viewMode=table&ws=admin$workspace``"
msgstr ""
"Also create a :ref:`secret <ecos_secret>` with **username/password** in "
"the journal ``/v2/journals?journalId=ecos-"
"secrets&viewMode=table&ws=admin$workspace``"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/subscription.rst:67
msgid ""
"И :ref:`конечную точку <endpoints_dsl>` с URL для загрузки файлов в "
"журнале "
"``/v2/journals?journalId=endpoints&viewMode=table&ws=admin$workspace``"
msgstr ""
"And create an :ref:`endpoint <endpoints_dsl>` with the URL for uploading "
"files in the journal "
"``/v2/journals?journalId=endpoints&viewMode=table&ws=admin$workspace``"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/subscription.rst:78
msgid ""
"Если конечная точка или секрет меняются, то необходимо перезапустить "
"Camel DSL, чтобы изменения подхватились."
msgstr ""
"If the endpoint or secret changes, Camel DSL must be restarted for the "
"changes to take effect."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/subscription.rst:80
msgid ""
